Project 1 - Threat Model the AI Identity System
Overview

This project focuses on threat modelling the AI identity system used in the SecureNova platform.

The main goal is to understand the different identities involved in the system, how they interact with each other, where trust boundaries exist, and how these identities can be attacked.

The analysis will cover STRIDE threat modelling, attack trees, MITRE ATT&CK mapping, and risk assessment.